Q) WRITE A SIMPLE WHILE LOOP
= 
public class Main{
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int i = 1;
        while(i<=9){
         System.out.println(i);
         i++;
        }
    }
}
USING FOR LOOP
public class Main{
    public static void main(String[] args) {
       for(int i =1;i<=9;i++){
           System.out.println(i);
       }
       
        
    }
}





